				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;">			<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>Early Access Roadmap</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/54423aa02ebfac64c0bc71729b6c71f3.avif?t=1793116832" width=780 height=1294 /></span></p></p>
			</div>
			</div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/9f19adba67d24336f7902898b04c9aee.avif?t=1793116832" width=780 height=80 /></span><strong>The sky froze over three generations ago. The state kept the mines open.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You are a miner. Your number is not important. Descend with your crew, fill the cart, and come back up. <i>Most</i> of you will come back up.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Coal Duty is a 1-5 player co-op extraction horror-comedy about hitting production targets in a hole full of things that eat production teams.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.poster.avif?t=1793116832" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.webm?t=1793116832" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.mp4?t=1793116832" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Mine &amp; Meet the Quota</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >You are sent into the depths to mine coal, but you don't have to report the loot you have found. Miss the quota, and the consequences follow you back. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every shift drops you into a freshly generated mine. Push deeper for a better haul and worse company. Tickets earned on delivery are the only currency the state recognizes.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.poster.avif?t=1793116832" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.webm?t=1793116832" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.mp4?t=1793116832" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Talk Quietly</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Proximity voice chat means your crew can only hear you when they are close. So can everything else. Call out a route, warn them about the thing in the tunnel, scream. The mine carries all of it equally.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.poster.avif?t=1793116832" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.webm?t=1793116832" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.mp4?t=1793116832" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>No Loitering</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Of course, you may enjoy your free time after hard work. Just remember who provides it.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Between shifts there are the barracks, the workshop, and there is also a smuggler in the restricted area. You did not hear that here.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.poster.avif?t=1793116832" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.webm?t=1793116832" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.mp4?t=1793116832" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.poster.avif?t=1793116832" width=800 height=442 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.webm?t=1793116832" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.mp4?t=1793116832" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Reported Hazards</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The mines are home to dozens of distinct creatures. Some are blind. Some are fast. Some look like coal until they aren't. Proceed accordingly.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.poster.avif?t=1793116832" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.webm?t=1793116832" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.mp4?t=1793116832" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>There Are Ways Out</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Sneak through to forbidden zones and build your escape plan between your shifts. Some miners have reportedly escaped. The state does not confirm this.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.poster.avif?t=1793116832" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.webm?t=1793116832" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.mp4?t=1793116832" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272370/extras/229dedacdbcda2c0c8c1de2c59fdb5d9.avif?t=1793116832" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Team up in 1-5 player online co-op.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Coordinate or panic over proximity voice chat.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Descend through procedurally generated mines with depth-based difficulty.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Return between shifts to a persistent hub: barracks, workshop, tavern, and a smuggler in the restricted area.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Escape by multiple routes, toward multiple endings.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><strong>Join the Union on Discord for updates!</strong></p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
